Prior work this project builds on
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The few-step causal student, the ODE-initialisation stage and the distribution-matching
distillation setup follow:

* CausVid — "From Slow Bidirectional to Fast Autoregressive Video Diffusion Models",
  arXiv:2412.07772. Cited in `model/ode_regression.py` and `wan/modules/causal_model.py`.
* Self-Forcing — the training-loop, scheduler and wrapper scaffolding in `utils/`,
  `trainer/` and `model/` follows its structure closely.

The force-conditioning datasets and the force-prompt overlay rendering in
`utils/forceprompt_data/` follow the Force Prompting line of work.

Please consult the licenses of those projects for terms covering the portions derived
from them.
